---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="페이지를 찾을 수 없습니다 (404 Not Found) | 메가머니모멘텀"
  description="요청하신 페이지가 삭제되었거나 주소가 변경되었습니다. 메가머니모멘텀 홈이나 통합 검색을 통해 원하시는 금융 정보를 찾아보세요."
>
  <div class="container-article" style="text-align: center; padding: 4rem 1rem;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 80px; height: 80px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--primary-light); color: var(--primary); font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      404
    </div>
    <h1 style="font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-main); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
      페이지를 찾을 수 없습니다
    </h1>
    <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 540px; margin: 0 auto 2rem; line-height: 1.6;">
      입력하신 웹 주소가 잘못되었거나, 페이지가 변경·삭제되었을 수 있습니다.<br />
      아래 검색창이나 추천 금융 도구를 통해 원하시는 정보를 찾아보세요.
    </p>

    <!-- Search Form -->
    <form action="/search" method="GET" style="max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto 2.5rem; position: relative;">
      <input
        type="search"
        name="q"
        placeholder="검색어를 입력하세요 (예: ISA 비과세, 연말정산, 커버드콜...)"
        style="width: 100%; padding: 0.9rem 1.25rem 0.9rem 2.85rem; font-size: 1rem; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); border: 2px solid var(--border-color); background: var(--bg-card); color: var(--text-main); font-family: inherit; outline: none; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);"
      />
      <svg
        width="18"
        height="18"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="2"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
        style="position: absolute; left: 1rem; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); color: var(--text-light);"
      >
        <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle>
        <line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line>
      </svg>
    </form>

    <!-- Action Buttons -->
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 0.75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
      <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary" style="padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; font-weight: 700;">홈으로 이동</a>
      <a href="/etf" class="btn btn-secondary" style="padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; font-weight: 700;">ETF 복리 시뮬레이터</a>
      <a href="/tools" class="btn btn-outline" style="padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; font-weight: 700;">절세 계산기</a>
      <a href="/qna" class="btn btn-outline" style="padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; font-weight: 700;">자주 묻는 질문(Q&A)</a>
    </div>

    <!-- Category Shortcuts -->
    <div style="background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 2rem; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: left;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-main); margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-align: center;">
        주요 카테고리 둘러보기
      </h3>
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 0.75rem;">
        <a href="/category/tax" style="padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: var(--bg-main); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); text-decoration: none; color: var(--text-main); font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
          <span>⚖️</span> 절세·세무 실무
        </a>
        <a href="/category/wealth" style="padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: var(--bg-main); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); text-decoration: none; color: var(--text-main); font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
          <span>📈</span> 자산관리·ISA
        </a>
        <a href="/category/stocks" style="padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: var(--bg-main); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); text-decoration: none; color: var(--text-main); font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
          <span>📊</span> 주식·ETF 투자
        </a>
        <a href="/category/subsidy" style="padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: var(--bg-main); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); text-decoration: none; color: var(--text-main); font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
          <span>🏛️</span> 정부지원금·정책
        </a>
        <a href="/category/economy" style="padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: var(--bg-main); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); text-decoration: none; color: var(--text-main); font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
          <span>🌐</span> 거시경제·금리
        </a>
        <a href="/en" style="padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: var(--bg-main); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); text-decoration: none; color: var(--text-main); font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
          <span>🇺🇸</span> English Edition
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
